<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλμῡρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything salt,</i> and so, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>salt humour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.13
			</span></i>; <i>salt scum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				357b4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>salt soil</i> or <i>land,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.5.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				39.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.237
			</span></i>, etc.; in Attica, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλίπεδον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.1059
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλμῡρίδες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				132
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> kind of 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράμβη,</span>
			<i>Brassica cretica,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eudem.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt;.<i><span class="en">
				369e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				736.73
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.801a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλιμον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>saliness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.39
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλμυρῖτις</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ,</span>
			= foreg. <i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zopyr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				14.62.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
